{"seq":3,"slug":"statistics-histograms","title":"统计信息与直方图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/optimization/statistics-histograms","wordCount":1442,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"统计信息与直方图\">统计信息与直方图</h1><p>代价优化器每一次打分，背后都是一次「这一步会出多少行」的基数估计；而基数估计准不准，全看它手里的统计信息质量。如果数据库以为某个值很罕见、实际却占了半张表，优化器就会自信地选出一个灾难计划。所以一个朴素但深刻的结论是：优化器选错计划，绝大多数时候不是算法不行，而是统计估歪了。这一篇讲清数据库为每列收集哪些统计、直方图如何刻画真实分布、以及列间相关性这个最难啃的骨头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>统计信息是优化器对数据的「认知」。它由 <code>ANALYZE</code>（或自动统计收集）通过采样建立，存在系统目录里，供 <a href=\"../foundations/cost-model\">代价模型与基数估计</a> 的选择性公式调用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[ANALYZE 采样表数据] --&gt; B[逐列统计]&#10;    B --&gt; C[n_distinct&lt;br/&gt;不同值个数]&#10;    B --&gt; D[null_frac&lt;br/&gt;空值比例]&#10;    B --&gt; E[most_common_vals&lt;br/&gt;高频值及频率]&#10;    B --&gt; F[histogram&lt;br/&gt;剩余值的分布]&#10;    C --&gt; G[供选择性估计调用]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[基数估计 → 代价打分]\">flowchart TD\n    A[ANALYZE 采样表数据] --&gt; B[逐列统计]\n    B --&gt; C[n_distinct&lt;br/&gt;不同值个数]\n    B --&gt; D[null_frac&lt;br/&gt;空值比例]\n    B --&gt; E[most_common_vals&lt;br/&gt;高频值及频率]\n    B --&gt; F[histogram&lt;br/&gt;剩余值的分布]\n    C --&gt; G[供选择性估计调用]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[基数估计 → 代价打分]</pre><p>下表列出关系型数据库逐列收集的核心统计项（以 PostgreSQL 的 <code>pg_stats</code> 视图为例）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>统计项</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>用于估计</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>n_distinct</code></td>\n<td>不同值的个数（NDV）</td>\n<td>等值选择性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>null_frac</code></td>\n<td>空值占比</td>\n<td><code>IS NULL</code> / <code>IS NOT NULL</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>most_common_vals</code></td>\n<td>最高频的几个值</td>\n<td>高频值的等值选择性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>most_common_freqs</code></td>\n<td>上述值各自的频率</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>histogram_bounds</code></td>\n<td>等频直方图边界</td>\n<td>范围条件选择性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>correlation</code></td>\n<td>列值与物理顺序的相关度</td>\n<td>索引扫描代价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要直方图\">为什么需要直方图</h2><p><a href=\"../foundations/cost-model\">代价模型与基数估计</a> 里的基础选择性公式假设数据均匀分布——等值选择性是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>，范围选择性按值域线性插值。但真实数据几乎从不均匀。一个「国家」列里中国和美国可能占了八成行，剩下两百个国家分剩下两成；按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d=200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span>）估每个国家占 0.5%，对中国就低估了上百倍。</p>\n<p>直方图就是为了刻画这种倾斜。它把列的值域切成若干桶，记录每个桶的边界，让范围条件 <code>col &lt; v</code> 能落到具体的桶里精确插值，而不是对整个值域线性猜。</p>\n<h2 id=\"等频直方图与高频值分离\">等频直方图与高频值分离</h2><p>数据库主流用等频直方图（equi-depth / equi-height histogram）：每个桶包含大致相同数量的行，桶宽随数据密度自动调整——值密集的区域桶窄、稀疏的区域桶宽。这比等宽直方图（每个桶值域宽度相同）更能适应倾斜分布。一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 桶的等频直方图，每桶约占 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 的行，范围条件 <code>col &lt; v</code> 落在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个桶内时，选择性约为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext>lo</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext>hi</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext>lo</mtext></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sel = \\frac{k}{B} + \\frac{1}{B} \\cdot \\frac{v - b_k^{\\text{lo}}}{b_k^{\\text{hi}} - b_k^{\\text{lo}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5483em;vertical-align:-1.0222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2791em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8309em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hi</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8309em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lo</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lo</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0222em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>PostgreSQL 还有个聪明的两段式设计：先把最高频的几个值（most_common_vals, MCV）单独拎出来精确记录其频率，剩下的值才进直方图。这样既精确处理了「中国占八成」这种尖峰，又用直方图覆盖了长尾。<code>default_statistics_target</code> 参数（默认 100）控制 MCV 和直方图桶的数量——调大它能让倾斜或宽值域的列估得更准，代价是 <code>ANALYZE</code> 更慢、目录更大，这是 <a href=\"../execution/tuning-observability\">查询调优与可观测性</a> 里常用的调优旋钮。</p>\n<h2 id=\"列间相关性-最难的部分\">列间相关性：最难的部分</h2><p>单列统计再准，也救不了列间相关性的坑。考虑 <code>WHERE city = &#39;北京&#39; AND province = &#39;北京市&#39;</code>。城市和省份高度相关——选了北京市，城市几乎必然是北京。但优化器默认假设列间独立，把两个条件的选择性直接相乘：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mtext>独立假设</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mtext>city</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mtext>province</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sel_{\\text{独立假设}} = sel_{\\text{city}} \\times sel_{\\text{province}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">独立假设</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">city</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">province</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这会严重低估实际行数（两个条件其实几乎重叠，真实选择性接近单个条件）。低估的后果是优化器以为中间结果很小，选了内存放不下的哈希连接、或本该用顺序扫描却用了索引——回到 <a href=\"../foundations/cost-model\">代价模型与基数估计</a> 讲的误差指数放大。</p>\n<p>补救手段是扩展统计（extended statistics）。PostgreSQL 的 <code>CREATE STATISTICS</code> 可以为一组列收集联合统计：函数依赖统计能识别「province 决定 city」，多列 NDV 统计能估准多列组合的不同值个数，多列 MCV 能记录高频的列值组合。建立后，优化器对这组列的联合条件就不再天真相乘。这也正是 <a href=\"cost-based-optimizer\">基于代价的优化器</a> 里学习型基数估计（NeuroCard、2026 年的 CorrBound 等）想自动解决的核心问题——用模型学习列间联合分布，省去手动建扩展统计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"统计的时效与维护\">统计的时效与维护</h2><p>统计是数据的快照，数据一变它就开始过时。一张表持续插入新数据后，旧统计会让优化器以为表还很小、值域还是旧范围，导致系统性误判。数据库靠两种机制维护：自动统计收集（PostgreSQL 的 autovacuum/autoanalyze 在表变更达到阈值时触发 <code>ANALYZE</code>），和手动 <code>ANALYZE</code>。</p>\n<p>实践中「查询昨天还好好的、今天突然变慢」的经典案例，往往就是统计过时或一次大批量导入后没及时 <code>ANALYZE</code>。诊断这类问题、对比估计基数与实际基数找出统计偏差，是 <a href=\"../execution/tuning-observability\">查询调优与可观测性</a> 的核心技能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>统计信息是优化器对数据的认知，由采样建立，是基数估计准确性的唯一来源；估歪是选错计划的首因。</li>\n<li>基础选择性公式假设均匀分布，直方图通过分桶刻画真实倾斜，让范围估计精确到桶内插值。</li>\n<li>主流用等频直方图，PostgreSQL 还把高频值（MCV）单独精确记录、长尾交给直方图，<code>default_statistics_target</code> 控制精度。</li>\n<li>列间相关性是最难的坑：默认独立假设会让联合条件选择性严重失真，需用扩展统计或学习型模型补救。</li>\n<li>统计是会过时的快照，需自动或手动 <code>ANALYZE</code> 维护；过时统计是查询「突然变慢」的经典原因。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"统计信息与直方图","id":"统计信息与直方图"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要直方图","id":"为什么需要直方图"},{"level":2,"text":"等频直方图与高频值分离","id":"等频直方图与高频值分离"},{"level":2,"text":"列间相关性：最难的部分","id":"列间相关性-最难的部分"},{"level":2,"text":"统计的时效与维护","id":"统计的时效与维护"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"基于代价的优化器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/optimization/cost-based-optimizer"},"next":{"title":"火山模型与向量化执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/execution/execution-models"}}